# No environment variables are required to run AniStream: every /api/... route
# the app calls (AniList GraphQL proxy, HiAnime, AniKoto, AniVexa, AnimeWixi,
# ANIME-API, partner analytics, MCP) is served locally by the middleware in
# vite.config.ts for both `vite dev` and `vite preview`.
#
# Optional development toggles:
# DISABLE_HMR=true   # disable Vite HMR / file watching (used by AI Studio)
#
# If you later add a third-party API key, keep it here (untracked except for
# this .env.example) and read it through import.meta.env.VITE_* — never hardcode
# keys in src/.
